  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating poaching and the illegal wildlife trade in Tanzania through an integrated approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To combat poaching and the illegal wildlife trade in Tanzania through an integrated approach .
(footnote 1) Integrated approach suggested by the project includes strengthening capacity of law enforcement agencies and involving of public and private sector to fight IWT, and development of  CBWM, SLM and SFM by local communities to provide alternatives to poaching.</narrative>
  </description>
